467
00:25:28.819 --> 00:25:30.488
Kumunsulta sa isang thoracic surgeon.

468
00:25:32.406 --> 00:25:33.407
Isang thoracic surgeon?

469
00:25:33.491 --> 00:25:34.909
Teka!

470
00:25:34.992 --> 00:25:38.287
Para kay Kristo! Anong uri ng kasuklam-suklam...

471
