- Oo, ginang.

609
00:34:27.399 --> 00:34:28.734
Patay ka pag nawala siya sayo.

610
00:34:28.817 --> 00:34:30.694
- Hakbang sa gas, ikaw idiot!
- Oo, ginang.

611
00:34:53.592 --> 00:34:56.929
